  "worked_solution": "The normal equation corresponding to $Ax=b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{T}\\,Ax & ={A}^{T}b \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}21 & 21 \\\\ 21 & 21\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=21+21+6=48.\n$$",
